  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU study on &#xbf;Barriers and Opportunities for Scaling up Rooftop Solar PV in Bangladesh&#xbf;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To support the Government of Bangladesh (GoB) in increasing the share of renewable energy in its energy mix to achieve country&#xbf;s Nationally Determined Contributions (NDC) objectives, EU Delegation Bangladesh is aiming to commission a study under this contract. The purpose of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To analyse the potential opportunities and barriers for scaling up rooftop solar for increasing renewable energy shares in the overall energy mix of the country.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To identify the constrains of implementation of Net Metering Policy in the country.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To identify possible solutions for scaling up Net Metering in the country&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To review international best practices around rooftop solar and recommend solutions best suited for Bangladesh&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
